  "question": {
    "text": "A thin convex lens of refractive index <math><mn>1.5</mn></math> has <math><mn>20</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> focal length in air. If the lens is completely immersed in a liquid of refractive index <math><mn>1.6</mn><mo>,</mo></math> its focal length will be"
  },
